Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: Something unexpected appeared after this value, found `<>`
  --> tests/ui/pipe_value_between_values.jet:4:10
    |
  4 |     if a <> b {
    |          ^^
 Why: After a value, an expression continues only with an operator: `==`, `!=`, `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=`, `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `&&`, `||`, `??` or `|>`
 Fix: Write the operator you mean, such as `!=` for not equal
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
